   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Location",
     "texto": [
      "**Di** introduces the place where something or someone is: **di rumah** (at home), **di Jakarta** (in Jakarta). Unlike English, the adjective comes after the noun: **kota besar** is literally \"city big\", meaning \"big city\". No word like English \"is\" is added in simple sentences such as **Jakarta kota besar**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Near and far",
     "texto": [
      "**Dekat** means \"near\" and **jauh**, \"far\". You can say **jauh dari universitas**: \"far from the university\". The word **di** is written separately from the place name."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
